Modifications

Modified since 2026-11-06. The main changes are:

- Added novel mode: background chapter records, tiered story context, a story
  memory panel the author can edit, chapter options and prose presentation.
- Removed Chatbox's account, Chatbox AI service, example conversations,
  onboarding, update checks, remote configuration and error reporting from the
  product.
- Replaced the name, logo and application identity.

The difference from that commit shows every change.


